From 573029f8fdcc08c846fe2568df96d7aef7039b43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eryk Wieliczko <eryk@wieliczko.ninja>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:52:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: describe T8132 platform controllers

Describe the M4 storage, retained input, radio, USB2, PMP and memory
controllers separately from J713 board activation. Preserve the current
CPU cache descriptions and use the existing timer, PMGR and watchdog
nodes from integration/aurora rather than duplicating them.

Keep optional controllers disabled until the board enables their qualified
power and firmware handoffs. The following commit installs J713 PMGR
ownership policy and its original-loader compatibility path atomically.

Source-commit: 050f1a0059233cf33918f9844a98ed273feb8bad
Source-snapshot: 6090f9eb8237c86526508d76a4539852089942d5
Assisted-by: LLM
